Third-party licenses: transit-texture
=====================================

The DSP in this crate is a Rust port of Emilie Gillet's MIT-licensed firmware (the texture
synthesizer in the eurorack repository, beads/dsp and beads/gain_control.cc, with the stmlib
helpers it uses), written by transit from her
C++ (no third-party Rust code is vendored). Provenance is in VENDOR.md. transit's port is MIT OR
Apache-2.0, like the rest of transit; as a derivative of her code it also stays under the MIT
notices below, both of which apply to it.


